{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"拉回"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"拉回 (范畴论)"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>在一个范畴中, <strong>拉回</strong> (pullback) 一般是指以如下范畴为指标范畴的"},{"Local":{"url":"极限","text":"极限"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n{ccc}\r\n&amp;&amp;\\bullet\\\\\r\n&amp;&amp;\\downarrow\\\\\r\n\\bullet &amp; \\to &amp;\\bullet\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n“多个对象指向一个对象” 的指标范畴的极限也可称为拉回. 对偶的操作称为"},{"Local":{"url":"推出","text":"推出"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>另见"},{"Local":{"url":"推前","text":"拉回 (纤维范畴)"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}